<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Rogue Automatic use Willpower &amp; Avoid Skills</Major>
    <Description>This macro allows you to automatically use the Willpower and Avoid skills from the Rogue class's scout skill list. Constantly clicking the skill bar with the mouse or pressing keys on the keyboard is very time-consuming; save time with this macro!

Usage: Place the Willpower skill on key 8 and the Avoid skill on key 9 in your skill bar. Assign the macro to any key you want using the keyboard or mouse and enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 


Created  by: damacana.
</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 37 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 37 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 38 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 38 1
Delay 30 ms
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rise Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>